#: kcmkonsole.cpp:193
msgid "<h1>Konsole</h1> With this module you can configure Konsole, the KDE terminal application. You can configure the generic Konsole options (which can also be configured using the RMB) and you can edit the schemas and sessions available to Konsole."
msgstr ""

